<title>UK: Aerodata drops out of fight for Scott.</title>
<headline>Aerodata drops out of fight for Scott.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian firm Aerodata Holdings said on Monday that it has decided that it no longer wishes to bid for British oil engineering services firm Scott Pickford Plc.</p>
</text>
